Relevant columns & why  
• "topic": filter to Health-related ads  
• "ad_format_type": choose IMAGE‑type ads  
• "advertiser_verification_status": keep only VERIFIED advertisers  
• "advertiser_location": take advertisers located in Cyprus (ISO “CY”)  
• "region_stats": JSON array that holds  
  – "region_code": must contain “HR” (Croatia)  
  – "first_shown"/"last_shown": date window checks  
  – "times_shown_availability_date": must be NULL (times shown data already available)  
  – "times_shown_upper_bound": number used to pick the largest value  
• "audience_selection_approach_info": JSON object that indicates how each targeting method was used; every key (demographic_info, geo_location, contextual_signals, customer_lists, topics_of_interest) must be different from “UNUSED”  
• "creative_page_url": final URL we want to return  

Typical filter conditions  
1. "topic" ILIKE '%health%'  
2. "ad_format_type" = 'IMAGE'  
3. "advertiser_verification_status" = 'VERIFIED'  
4. "advertiser_location" = 'CY'  
5. In region_stats flatten row  
  a. "region_code" = 'HR'  
  b. "first_shown" > '2023‑01‑01'  
  c. "last_shown"  < '2024‑01‑01'  
  d. "times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL  
6. In audience_selection_approach_info JSON each field NOT ILIKE '%UNUSED%'  

Below are 10 exploratory Snowflake SQL statements (LIMIT 20 each) that move from simple inspection toward the final answer.  
All column names are quoted; JSON is accessed with value:field notation.  

```sql
-- 1. Description: Quick look at Health‑topic ads to inspect available columns
SELECT "creative_id",
       "advertiser_disclosed_name",
       "topic",
       "ad_format_type",
       "advertiser_location"
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS
WHERE "topic" ILIKE '%health%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: Distinct advertiser locations for IMAGE‑type Health ads
SELECT DISTINCT "advertiser_location"
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS
WHERE "topic" ILIKE '%health%'
  AND "ad_format_type" = 'IMAGE'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: Examine the JSON structure of region_stats for Croatian impressions
SELECT t."creative_id",
       r.value AS region_json
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."region_stats"::VARIANT) r
WHERE r.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: See which targeting keys appear inside audience_selection_approach_info
SELECT DISTINCT get_path(a.value, '$') AS key_name
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."audience_selection_approach_info"::VARIANT) a
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: Pull Croatian IMAGE‑type Health ads from VERIFIED advertisers in Cyprus
SELECT t."creative_id",
       t."creative_page_url",
       r.value:"first_shown"::DATE   AS first_shown,
       r.value:"last_shown"::DATE    AS last_shown,
       r.value:"times_shown_availability_date"          AS avail_dt
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."region_stats"::VARIANT) r
WHERE t."topic" ILIKE '%health%'
  AND t."ad_format_type" = 'IMAGE'
  AND t."advertiser_verification_status" = 'VERIFIED'
  AND t."advertiser_location" = 'CY'
  AND r.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: Enforce the date window (first_shown after 2023‑01‑01)
SELECT t."creative_id",
       r.value:"first_shown"::DATE AS first_shown
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."region_stats"::VARIANT) r
WHERE r.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND r.value:"first_shown"::DATE > '2023-01-01'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Description: Enforce last_shown before 2024‑01‑01
SELECT t."creative_id",
       r.value:"last_shown"::DATE AS last_shown
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."region_stats"::VARIANT) r
WHERE r.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND r.value:"last_shown"::DATE < '2024-01-01'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Description: Keep rows where times_shown data already available (availability_date IS NULL)
SELECT t."creative_id",
       r.value:"times_shown_availability_date" AS avail_date
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."region_stats"::VARIANT) r
WHERE r.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND r.value:"times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Description: Check that every targeting method is used (none = UNUSED)
SELECT t."creative_id",
       a.value:"demographic_info"::STRING        AS demographic_info,
       a.value:"geo_location"::STRING            AS geo_location,
       a.value:"contextual_signals"::STRING      AS contextual_signals,
       a.value:"customer_lists"::STRING          AS customer_lists,
       a.value:"topics_of_interest"::STRING      AS topics_of_interest
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => ARRAY_CONSTRUCT(t."audience_selection_approach_info"::VARIANT)) a
WHERE t."ad_format_type" = 'IMAGE'
  AND t."topic" ILIKE '%health%'
  AND t."advertiser_location" = 'CY'
  AND (a.value:"demographic_info"     IS NULL OR a.value:"demographic_info"::STRING    ILIKE '%UNUSED%') = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"geo_location"         IS NULL OR a.value:"geo_location"::STRING        ILIKE '%UNUSED%') = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"contextual_signals"   IS NULL OR a.value:"contextual_signals"::STRING  ILIKE '%UNUSED%') = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"customer_lists"       IS NULL OR a.value:"customer_lists"::STRING      ILIKE '%UNUSED%') = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"topics_of_interest"   IS NULL OR a.value:"topics_of_interest"::STRING  ILIKE '%UNUSED%') = FALSE
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--10. Description: Final query – Health IMAGE ad from Cyprus verified advertiser, served in Croatia (HR),
--                  correct date window, times_shown data available, all targeting methods used.
--                  Retrieves the creative_page_url having highest times_shown_upper_bound
SELECT t."creative_page_url"
FROM GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.CREATIVE_STATS t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."region_stats"::VARIANT) r,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => ARRAY_CONSTRUCT(t."audience_selection_approach_info"::VARIANT)) a
WHERE t."topic" ILIKE '%health%'
  AND t."ad_format_type" = 'IMAGE'
  AND t."advertiser_verification_status" = 'VERIFIED'
  AND t."advertiser_location" = 'CY'
  -- Region filters
  AND r.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND r.value:"first_shown"::DATE > '2023-01-01'
  AND r.value:"last_shown" ::DATE < '2024-01-01'
  AND r.value:"times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL
  -- Targeting methods must not be UNUSED
  AND (a.value:"demographic_info"::STRING     ILIKE '%UNUSED%')        = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"geo_location"::STRING         ILIKE '%UNUSED%')        = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"contextual_signals"::STRING   ILIKE '%UNUSED%')        = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"customer_lists"::STRING       ILIKE '%UNUSED%')        = FALSE
  AND (a.value:"topics_of_interest"::STRING   ILIKE '%UNUSED%')        = FALSE
ORDER BY r.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::NUMBER DESC
LIMIT 1;
```

