Column name: advertiser_id Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier for a specific advertiser
Column name: advertiser_verification_status Type: TEXT Description: Whether or not the advertiser has verified their identity with Google yet
Column name: advertiser_legal_name Type: TEXT Description: The legal name of the advertiser
Column name: advertiser_location Type: TEXT Description: ISO 3166-2 region code (for example "FR" for France)
